Verification against the C binary compiled with [38;5;10mgcc -O2[0m: 14 hand-built edge cases (empty input, no trailing newline, bare newlines, lines spanning exactly 127 and 300 bytes, leading and mid-chunk NULs, CRLF, all byte values 1–255, invalid UTF-8, 5000 lines) plus 400 randomized inputs weighted toward newlines and NUL bytes. All byte-identical, exit codes matching.[0m[0m
